                        </m3e-card>

                        <m3e-card variant="outlined" class="review">
                            <div class="card-pad">
                                <div class="review-header">
                                <strong class="review-author">BechamelBoss</strong>
                                <span class="stars" role="img" aria-label="4 out of 5 stars">
                                    <piko:svg src="@/lib/icons/star.svg" fill="currentColor" width="16" height="16"></piko:svg>
                                    <piko:svg src="@/lib/icons/star.svg" fill="currentColor" width="16" height="16"></piko:svg>
                                    <piko:svg src="@/lib/icons/star.svg" fill="currentColor" width="16" height="16"></piko:svg>
                                    <piko:svg src="@/lib/icons/star.svg" fill="currentColor" width="16" height="16"></piko:svg>
                                    <piko:svg src="@/lib/icons/star.svg" fill="currentColor" width="16" height="16" class="star-off"></piko:svg>
                                </span>
                            </div>
                                <p class="review-body">The b&eacute;chamel makes it. I've tried lasagna recipes without it and they just can't compare. This one is creamy, cheesy, and comforting in all the right ways.</p>

                            </div>
                        </m3e-card>

                        <m3e-card variant="outlined" class="review">
                            <div class="card-pad">
                                <div class="review-header">
                                <strong class="review-author">RicottaRobber</strong>
                                <span class="stars" role="img" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">
                                    <piko:svg src="@/lib/icons/star.svg" fill="currentColor" width="16" height="16"></piko:svg>
                                    <piko:svg src="@/lib/icons/star.svg" fill="currentColor" width="16" height="16"></piko:svg>
                                    <piko:svg src="@/lib/icons/star.svg" fill="currentColor" width="16" height="16"></piko:svg>
                                    <piko:svg src="@/lib/icons/star.svg" fill="currentColor" width="16" height="16"></piko:svg>
                                    <piko:svg src="@/lib/icons/star.svg" fill="currentColor" width="16" height="16"></piko:svg>
                                </span>
                            </div>
                                <p class="review-body">I ate all the ricotta with a spoon before it made it into the lasagna. Had to go buy more. Ate half of that too. Third tub made it into the dish but I won&rsquo;t pretend I didn&rsquo;t stand at the counter eating spoonfuls between layers. The lasagna was thin. My happiness was not.</p>

                            </div>
